    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d335">

                <pb facs="0555" n="453" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg453"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A14/741: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Persia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hornibrook</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-03-01T10:00:00+03:25">March 1, 1935—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 1—9:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>11. Foreign Office urgently requests that in the event of elimination of
                    reservation to Arms Traffic Convention<anchor n="2" xml:id="d335-f1"/> that some
                    official statement be made at the same time so action will not be construed by
                    other powers as Senate repudiation of any rights Persia may have in the
                    Gulf.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hornibrook</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d335-f1" n="2" xml:id="d335-f1-content">
                <p>For text of the convention, see <ref target="frus1925v01#pg_61">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, 1925, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >i</hi>, p. 61</ref>; for text of the reservation, introduced by Senator
                    King of Utah and adopted by the Senate June 15, 1934, see <ref
                        target="frus1934v01#pg_462">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, 1934, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >i</hi>, p. 462</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
